  "description": "The world has never seen an Omegaverse story quite like this. Beta top X Beta bottom?! The Omegaverse setting was simply an excuse!\n\nDa-hoon and Sung-joon entered into an arranged marriage for business reasons. Despite their arranged marriage, they were as reputable as any other Alpha-Omega couple thanks to their outstanding personalities.\n\nBut they each had a secret... “He must never find out that I’m a Beta!”\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/notbeta)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/notbeta), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/notbeta)\n\n##### Note: The official T.Chinese translation is uncensored.",
